  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog 0.1.6\n\n## Changes since 0.1.0\n\n- Name SMB2 tracks correctly and end sounds that outlast the reference (#10) (`88f9284`)\n- Write NES DMC samples into the VGM (#9) (`3c214a7`)\n- Add an agent guide (#6) (`953ae00`)\n- Rename the package to SoulRipper.Tool and the command to soulripper (#5) (`c2e1d05`)\n- Write gzipped .vgz by default (#4) (`8734e7d`)\n- End effects when they stop being heard (#3) (`c5b0a1a`)\n",
